    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19685" root="سرى" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَارٍ</span></b>  <i>Journeying,</i> or <i>travelling, by night,</i> or <i>in
the night, in a general sense:</i> (M, TA: *) pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُرَاةٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Hence, because of his going
[about] by night, (TA,) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّارِى</span> signifies <i>The
lion;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُسَارِى</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُسْتَرِى</span></b> . (K,
TA.)

